Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:12.74,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 65S\fs50\frz15\fax0.04\c&HB9AD9B&\pos(1251.2,801.6)}三人少女乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:12.74,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 65S\fs50\frz15.5\fax0.04\c&HB9AD9B&\pos(1145.6,906.133)}原钻石星尘的桃香值得注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:12.74,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 65S\fs50\frz15\fax0.04\c&HA99D8E&\pos(1225.6,1011.2)}歌曲好帅！大家好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:22.69,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 65S\fs50\frz-29\fax\c&HC7C3C1&\pos(1085.333,421.867)}红生姜
